  <History Date="19-04-12" Author="Locate Fix" Comment="Updated locate, power on, highlight and lowlight values to valid values" />
  <History Date="19-04-13" Author="RDM Sync Tool" Comment="Added RDM Manufacturer information." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="28-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed name from Mania EFX500 to Mania EFX 500.  Changed physical type from fixed to moving mirror." />
  <History Date="28-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed shutter 'no function' to 'Open' for compatibility.  Increased wheel resolution." />
  <History Date="28-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added macros.  Added gobo palettes.  Shortened function names to fit in all displays." />
  <History Date="28-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised conditionals.  Moved raw functions into else conditions and fixed duplicate else functions." />
